# TableViewer

- _TableViewer(k, t, m)_

Table viewer.
Add a window to `SmallKansas` with the title _t_ displaying a table of the matrix at _m_.

~~~spl smallKansas
system.smallKansas.TableViewer(
	'Luoshu',
	[
		4 9 2;
		3 5 7;
		8 1 6
	]
)
~~~

* * *

See also: PngViewer, SmallKansas, SvgViewer

Guides: Small Kansas
